<control id="u1266345b-1006" class="AppControlSidecar" script="u1266345b-1006"><graphic language=""><text text="Part of the Cisco® ASR 9000 Series, the Cisco ASR 9001 Router is a compact high-capacity Provider Edge (PE) router that delivers 120 Gbps of nonblocking, full-duplex fabric capacity in a two-rack-unit (2RU) form factor. Based on the same Cisco IOS® XR software image as the other routers in the Cisco ASR 9000 Series, the Cisco ASR 9001 Router delivers the features and services found on the ASR 9000 Series platforms, allowing customers to standardize on the same Cisco IOS XR image. The Cisco ASR 9001 Router has an Integrated Route Switch Processor (RSP) and two modular bays that support GE, 10 GE, and 40 GE Modular Port Adapters (MPAs)." html="html"><![CDATA[Part of the Cisco® ASR 9000 Series, the Cisco ASR 9001 Router is a compact high-capacity Provider Edge (PE) router that delivers 120 Gbps of nonblocking, full-duplex fabric capacity in a two-rack-unit (2RU) form factor. Based on the same Cisco IOS® XR software image as the other routers in the Cisco ASR 9000 Series, the Cisco ASR 9001 Router delivers the features and services found on the ASR 9000 Series platforms, allowing customers to standardize on the same Cisco IOS XR image. The Cisco ASR 9001 Router has an Integrated Route Switch Processor (RSP) and two modular bays that support GE, 10 GE, and 40 GE Modular Port Adapters (MPAs).]]></text><field name="titleText" value="Cisco ASR 9001"/></graphic>
